#. ~ Scenario name
#: scenarios/berserk_pursuer.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "(BERSERK) Immortal Zodd"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Scenario name
#: scenarios/berserk_pursuer.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "(BERSERK) Immortal Zodd"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Scenario description
#: scenarios/berserk_pursuer.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You awaken in a dark forest, where Nosferatu Zodd's heavy footsteps and roar"
" already echo through the trees. The legendary apostle has hunted you from "
"the very beginning. This is more than survival—it is a duel in which every "
"second may be your last. Can you escape his crushing blows, lure him into a "
"trap, or face him with nothing but strength and cunning? Prepare for a "
"battle against a demon more powerful than anything in this ruined world."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Scenario description
#: scenarios/berserk_pursuer.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You awaken in a dark forest, where Nosferatu Zodd's heavy footsteps and roar"
" already echo through the trees. The legendary apostle has hunted you from "
"the very beginning. This is more than survival—it is a duel in which every "
"second may be your last. Can you escape his crushing blows, lure him into a "
"trap, or face him with nothing but strength and cunning? Prepare for a "
"battle against a demon more powerful than anything in this ruined world."
msgstr ""

