#: bionics/arm_cannon.json
msgid "Lost left hand"
msgstr ""

#: bionics/arm_cannon.json
msgid "Your left hand is gone. This permanent interface anchors a prosthetic arm cannon; it cannot grip objects or help wield a weapon with both hands. You learn the recipes for 'prosthetic arm cannon CBM' and 'arm cannon charge'. Craft the cannon and activate it from your inventory to attach it yourself, without power or surgery."
msgstr ""

#: bionics/arm_cannon.json
msgid "Removing this interface cannot restore the missing hand."
msgstr ""

#: bionics/arm_cannon.json
msgid "Prosthetic arm cannon"
msgstr ""

#: bionics/arm_cannon.json
msgid "A mechanical cannon mounted on the left arm after activating the crafted 'prosthetic arm cannon CBM' in your inventory. Activate this bionic to wield and reload its single chamber, then retract it to take up your sword again. It burns powder charges instead of bionic power."
msgstr ""

#: items/bionics/arm_cannon_cbms.json
msgid "lost left hand interface CBM"
msgstr ""

#: items/bionics/arm_cannon_cbms.json
msgid "An interface left behind after the hand is lost. It cannot restore your grip, but provides a mount for a prosthetic cannon. Installing it teaches the recipes for 'prosthetic arm cannon CBM' and 'arm cannon charge'. Activate the crafted cannon from your inventory to attach it yourself, without power or surgery."
msgstr ""

#: items/bionics/arm_cannon_cbms.json
msgid "prosthetic arm cannon CBM"
msgstr ""

#: items/bionics/arm_cannon_cbms.json
msgid "A handmade mechanical arm cannon. With the lost left-hand interface installed, activate this item directly in your inventory to attach it yourself, even with your remaining hand occupied. Do not wield it to install it. No power, surgical equipment, or other materials are required. The item is consumed only after the prosthetic arm cannon bionic is successfully installed."
msgstr ""

#: items/guns/arm_cannon.json
msgid "prosthetic arm cannon"
msgstr ""

#: items/guns/arm_cannon.json
msgid "An integrated single-shot cannon fitted to the left arm.  Reload it with a powder charge and retract it when you need your sword."
msgstr ""

#: items/ammo/arm_cannon_charge.json
msgid "arm cannon charge"
msgstr ""

#: items/ammo/arm_cannon_charge.json
msgid "A single heavy projectile and black powder charge prepared for the prosthetic arm cannon."
msgstr ""

