msgid "The Skull Knight opens a path through the Eclipse. 'Hold on. We leave now.'"
msgstr ""

#: effects/eclipse_aftermath_eocs.json
msgid "The Skull Knight has brought you back. Your left hand and an eye are gone. The Brand of Sacrifice burns on your body. You can now craft the prosthetic arm cannon and its charge. Activate the crafted cannon from your inventory to attach it yourself."
msgstr ""

#: monsters/skull_knight_rescuer.json
msgid "The Skull Knight who pulled you from the Eclipse. He will speak with you, but will not turn his sword on you or your allies."
msgstr ""

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'The Eclipse has not claimed you yet. I will cut a way out. Stay close.' Beyond his shoulder, the darkness recoils from his blade."
msgstr ""

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "What is happening?"
msgstr ""

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "Get me out of here."
msgstr ""

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'Survive first. Answers can wait.' He raises his sword, and a path opens through the dark."
msgstr ""

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "Follow the Skull Knight."
msgstr ""

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'You escaped, but the Eclipse has marked you. Your hand is gone. What comes next is yours to decide.'"
msgstr ""

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "How can I replace my hand?"
msgstr ""

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "I need to go."
msgstr ""

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'Craft the prosthetic arm cannon and its charge. Once the cannon is made, activate it from your inventory. The mount where your left hand used to be will hold it.'"
msgstr ""

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "I understand."
msgstr ""

