#: items/post_eclipse_journal.json
msgid "The first sealed breach opened several paths. Activate this journal to follow the Skull Knight's remembered directions to Flora, consider protecting a refuge, or trace the Count's residence. His hunt has its own record and local breach."
msgstr ""

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "I am ready to accept the armor and face the attack."
msgstr ""

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "I understand the danger. Give me the armor and the escape charm."
msgstr ""

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "Not yet. I need to prepare and ask more."
msgstr ""

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "I need another escape charm before I begin."
msgstr ""

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "\"There is no more time for counsel. The guardians are holding the northern and eastern approaches. Leave through the western road or the southern garden. Do not wait for a victory.\""
msgstr ""

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "\"If you take this road, the sanctuary will not remain your shelter. I will entrust the missing armor to you, and the guardians will buy time. Zodd approaches from the north; Grunbeld from the east. Do not try to defeat both. Prepare first, then activate my escape charm to begin. The western door and southern garden offer two ways out. Once you begin, there is no return to this peaceful house.\""
msgstr ""

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "Flora's escape charm"
msgstr ""

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "Begin the escape from Flora's manor"
msgstr ""

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "Flora's token of your decision. Equip and pack the armor before activating it in her manor. Activation starts a one-time attack: guardians delay Zodd and Grunbeld, and you must leave by the western road or southern garden. It needs no power and does not teleport you. It cannot restart the siege."
msgstr ""

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "Begin the one-time attack now? Prepare your armor first. The sanctuary will be lost; escape through the western road or southern garden."
msgstr ""

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "Flora entrusts you with the armor and an escape charm. Equip and pack what you need first. Activate Flora's escape charm in the manor when ready: that starts the attack. Leave by the western door or the southern garden path; you need not kill the apostles. Until you activate it, the siege does not advance."
msgstr ""

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "wood cracking beyond the ward"
msgstr ""

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "The ward trembles. Root guardians rise outside the house as footsteps approach from the north and east. ESCAPE: use the western door or the southern door, then follow the ash-marked path beyond the grove. Zodd and Grunbeld arrive in about 30 seconds. Escape, not victory, is the objective."
msgstr ""

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "The charm cannot begin another attack. Prepare with Flora after the Eclipse, then activate it in her still-peaceful manor."
msgstr ""

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "The northern ward breaks under a great blade; an armored giant closes from the east. The guardians can only delay them. Both escape paths remain open. Keep moving toward the western road or the southern garden exit."
msgstr ""

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "The upper rooms char and a section of the eastern wall gives way. The ward holds the embers back from the western and southern escape paths. Take what you need and leave the grove; staying to fight is your choice."
msgstr ""

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "You reach the far side of the grove. Behind you, Flora's sanctuary becomes a silent, charred ruin. Its protection is gone. Apostles you killed remain dead; surviving attackers are not erased. Recover at your refuge, then follow the Count's trail when ready."
msgstr ""

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "An attacker could not enter the grove because its approach is blocked. Your escape remains available; the siege will not summon replacements endlessly."
msgstr ""

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "Flora's root guardian"
msgid_plural "Flora's root guardians"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "Flora's root guardians"
msgstr ""

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "A knot of living roots raised by Flora outside her sanctuary. It holds its ground to delay the attackers, buying you time to escape. It will not attack you or your companions."
msgstr ""

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "Nosferatu Zodd, attacker of the grove"
msgstr ""

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "The real Zodd has come to destroy Flora's sanctuary. Root guardians delay him at the northern ward. You are meant to escape, but if you kill him his death is recorded for future stories."
msgstr ""

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "Grunbeld, attacker of the grove"
msgstr ""

