#: furniture/location_scenery.json furniture/rosine_cocoons.json effects/rosine_cocoon_eocs.json mapgen/named_hunt_palettes.json
msgid "A split Mistvale cocoon. The creature inside has already left; this shell cannot produce another."
msgstr ""

#: furniture/location_scenery.json furniture/rosine_cocoons.json effects/rosine_cocoon_eocs.json mapgen/named_hunt_palettes.json
msgid "A large, motionless cocoon among the flowers. Its opaque silk hides the shape inside. It can be smashed, but this dormant shell does not release a creature."
msgstr ""

#: furniture/location_scenery.json furniture/rosine_cocoons.json effects/rosine_cocoon_eocs.json mapgen/named_hunt_palettes.json
msgid "Something moves behind the silk. Examine it to open the shell deliberately; one creature may emerge. Smashing it destroys the shell instead."
msgstr ""

#: furniture/location_scenery.json furniture/rosine_cocoons.json effects/rosine_cocoon_eocs.json mapgen/named_hunt_palettes.json
msgid "Torn silk and crushed remains mark a destroyed cocoon. It cannot release creatures."
msgstr ""

#: furniture/location_scenery.json furniture/rosine_cocoons.json effects/rosine_cocoon_eocs.json mapgen/named_hunt_palettes.json
msgid "Cut open the stirring cocoon? A creature may emerge beside it."
msgstr ""

#: furniture/location_scenery.json furniture/rosine_cocoons.json effects/rosine_cocoon_eocs.json mapgen/named_hunt_palettes.json
msgid "The silk splits. A winged creature crawls free, leaving an empty shell."
msgstr ""

#: furniture/location_scenery.json furniture/rosine_cocoons.json effects/rosine_cocoon_eocs.json mapgen/named_hunt_palettes.json
msgid "The cocoon remains sealed: there is no room for its occupant to emerge."
msgstr ""

#: furniture/location_scenery.json furniture/rosine_cocoons.json effects/rosine_cocoon_eocs.json mapgen/named_hunt_palettes.json
msgid "The survey journal ends in mid-sentence. A chalk diagram links the specimen case to the disturbances in the forest. The tents were torn from outside; nobody finished packing."
msgstr ""

#: furniture/location_scenery.json furniture/rosine_cocoons.json effects/rosine_cocoon_eocs.json mapgen/named_hunt_palettes.json
msgid "Names have been scraped from the memorial. Beneath the altar, black wax covers a chain of handprints. A narrow side aisle leads around the nave; the bell mechanism is in the western tower."
msgstr ""

#: furniture/location_scenery.json furniture/rosine_cocoons.json effects/rosine_cocoon_eocs.json mapgen/named_hunt_palettes.json
msgid "Drag marks lead from the stripped camp into the sunken hollow. The creature has dragged its victims behind the broken stone screens. The supply bundle lies off the main approach."
msgstr ""

#: furniture/location_scenery.json furniture/rosine_cocoons.json effects/rosine_cocoon_eocs.json mapgen/named_hunt_palettes.json
msgid "The ruined foundation has split around a living fissure. Ash covers the approach, but the central wound is still open. Sealing it will suppress new manifestations nearby, not remove creatures already here."
msgstr ""

#: furniture/location_scenery.json furniture/rosine_cocoons.json effects/rosine_cocoon_eocs.json mapgen/named_hunt_palettes.json
msgid "Broken shields, shackles and stolen clothing hang beside the training yard. The prisoners scratched an escape route around the tents. Beyond the stone screens lies the leader's fighting ground."
msgstr ""

#: furniture/location_scenery.json furniture/rosine_cocoons.json effects/rosine_cocoon_eocs.json mapgen/named_hunt_palettes.json
msgid "Tiny shoes and torn toys lie under flowers that grow around the cocoons. This promise of paradise ended here. Some cocoons are split and empty; sealed ones still move."
msgstr ""

#: furniture/location_scenery.json furniture/rosine_cocoons.json effects/rosine_cocoon_eocs.json mapgen/named_hunt_palettes.json
msgid "Notes on herbs and wards lie beside unfinished repairs. The west road and southern garden are kept clear. Take time to prepare before agreeing to the attack; these two routes are meant for escape."
msgstr ""

#: furniture/location_scenery.json furniture/rosine_cocoons.json effects/rosine_cocoon_eocs.json mapgen/named_hunt_palettes.json
msgid "The standard survived a siege that melted its fittings. Broken ramparts offer cover on the approach. Inside the crucible, leave the marked breath line during preparation; the dragon cannot turn the shot after aiming."
msgstr ""

#: missions/named_hunts.json effects/apostle_committed_attacks.json effects/hunt_site_placement_eocs.json
msgid "A heavy blow crashes through the marked sector!"
msgstr ""

#: missions/named_hunts.json effects/apostle_committed_attacks.json effects/hunt_site_placement_eocs.json
msgid "A new objective has been added to your missions. Select it in the mission journal to follow its exact overmap target; your other hunts remain active."
msgstr ""

#: missions/named_hunts.json effects/apostle_committed_attacks.json effects/hunt_site_placement_eocs.json
msgid "After sealing the Count, Wyald and Rosine breaches, follow the marked stronghold trail. Defeat both forms in the crucible, seal this site and claim its relic. A recorded death during Flora's siege remains valid."
msgstr ""

#: missions/named_hunts.json effects/apostle_committed_attacks.json effects/hunt_site_placement_eocs.json
msgid "An existing unique site lies outside the preferred spacing. Its position is preserved and the objective is registered there."
msgstr ""

#: missions/named_hunts.json effects/apostle_committed_attacks.json effects/hunt_site_placement_eocs.json
msgid "Close the ashen breach"
msgstr ""

#: missions/named_hunts.json effects/apostle_committed_attacks.json effects/hunt_site_placement_eocs.json
msgid "Defeat the guardian at the marked breach, then examine the wound at its center to seal it. Existing demons remain. Read your journal afterward to choose another trail."
msgstr ""

#: missions/named_hunts.json effects/apostle_committed_attacks.json effects/hunt_site_placement_eocs.json
msgid "Enter the marked camp and explore its stores and prisoner cages. The apostle waits in the southeastern fighting ground. Defeat him, examine the breach and claim the Beast Knot."
msgstr ""

#: missions/named_hunts.json effects/apostle_committed_attacks.json effects/hunt_site_placement_eocs.json
msgid "Explore the marked residence, descend below the execution hall and defeat the Count. Examine his exposed breach, seal it and claim the relic. The other hunts keep separate progress."
msgstr ""

#: missions/named_hunts.json effects/apostle_committed_attacks.json effects/hunt_site_placement_eocs.json
msgid "Flora: sanctuary and escape"
msgstr ""

#: missions/named_hunts.json effects/apostle_committed_attacks.json effects/hunt_site_placement_eocs.json
msgid "Follow the marked valley through flowers and cocoons to its southeastern nest. Defeat Rosine, seal her breach and claim the Mistvale Veil. Some cocoons can be opened or destroyed."
msgstr ""

#: missions/named_hunts.json effects/apostle_committed_attacks.json effects/hunt_site_placement_eocs.json
msgid "Hunt Grunbeld in the scarred stronghold"
msgstr ""

#: missions/named_hunts.json effects/apostle_committed_attacks.json effects/hunt_site_placement_eocs.json
msgid "Hunt Rosine in Mistvale"
msgstr ""

#: missions/named_hunts.json effects/apostle_committed_attacks.json effects/hunt_site_placement_eocs.json
