msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.2: player text cleanup
#: effects/flora_treehouse_eocs.json
msgid "Only charred edges remain of the unfinished notes. A few lines are still legible, but the fire took most of the knowledge they held."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.2: player text cleanup
#: effects/flora_treehouse_eocs.json
