#. New Horizon 3.2: player text cleanup
#: effects/grunbeld_hunt_eocs.json
msgid "A deep rumble rises from the breach. While its guardian lives, the wound will not close."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.2: player text cleanup
#: effects/grunbeld_hunt_eocs.json
msgid "The broken armor lies still, but the ground trembles beneath it. Something is trying to emerge."
